id: pmc-366b
title: Adopt authoritative completion-timestamp contract from pm-cli SDK
description: "Replace the hand-rolled completed_at->closed_at->updated_at->created_at chain in src/generator.ts with resolveCompletionTimestamp from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk, bump the dependency to 2026.7.29, and thread the returned source/fallback provenance through release attribution so inferred (fallback) attributions are distinguishable from authoritative completed_at ones. Surface the provenance in the release-context/generation report. Keep rendered CHANGELOG.md byte-identical for already-correct items; preserve created_at as the final local fallback when the SDK returns no timestamp. Add tests for all three source values and the all-absent path plus inferred-vs-authoritative reporting. Update README/docs."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-07-29T04:31:50.904Z"
updated_at: "2026-07-29T04:43:15.322Z"
closed_at: "2026-07-29T04:43:15.303Z"
completed_at: "2026-07-29T04:43:15.303Z"
author: pi-agent
resolution: implemented
expected_result: Generator uses SDK resolveCompletionTimestamp for the completed_at->closed_at->updated_at chain with created_at as final local fallback; provenance (source/fallback) reported in --explain; CHANGELOG.md byte-identical for existing entries; coverage gate green
actual_result: "All 202 tests pass (9 new). Coverage 90.17% lines / 79.64% branches / 90.79% functions, thresholds met. CHANGELOG.md regeneration diff empty before closing. changelog:check, audit:prod, typecheck all green."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T04:32:02.038Z",pi-agent,"Baseline established: 193 tests pass, coverage 89.81% lines / 79.00% branches / 90.71% functions, thresholds met. Current hand-rolled chain at src/generator.ts:1537 itemTimestamp(): completed_at ?? closed_at ?? updated_at ?? created_at. SDK resolveCompletionTimestamp (verified on host @unbrained/pm-cli@2026.7.29) returns {timestamp, source, fallback} where source is completed_at|closed_at|updated_at and fallback=true for closed_at/updated_at. When all three absent, SDK returns {source:'updated_at', fallback:true} with NO timestamp field -- so created_at must remain the final local fallback to avoid regressing the no-timestamp path."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T04:42:49.773Z",pi-agent,"Implementation: src/generator.ts now imports resolveCompletionTimestamp + CompletionTimestampSource from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk (top-level import, no await import, no any). resolveItemCompletion() delegates the SDK chain and adds created_at as the final local fallback; itemTimestamp() now wraps it so filterItemsByTime/compareItems are byte-identical. ChangelogAttributionProvenance (authoritative/inferred/inferred_sources/inferred_sample) added to ChangelogSelectionReport and surfaced in explainChangelogSelection + writeSelectionReport stderr + a hint. New type exported from src/index.ts. Bumped devDep ^2026.7.29 and peerDep >=2026.7.29, regenerated package-lock.json. 9 new tests cover all three sources, all-absent created_at fallback, unplaceable, and inferred-vs-authoritative reporting. Coverage 90.17% lines / 79.64% branches / 90.79% functions (up from 89.81/79.00/90.71). CHANGELOG.md regeneration diff is empty (byte-identical) before closing."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-29T04:42:49.895Z",pi-agent,"The pm-cli SDK resolveCompletionTimestamp (lifecycle-completion.ts) chain is completed_at -> closed_at -> updated_at and returns {timestamp, source, fallback} where fallback is false ONLY for completed_at. When all three are absent the SDK returns {source:'updated_at', fallback:true} with NO timestamp property (its declared return type marks timestamp: string, a type/runtime gap). pm-changelog must keep created_at as the final local fallback so no item is unplaceable. The SDK input type requires updated_at: string but PmItem types it optional -- bridge with an unknown cast (no any) to a narrower all-optional input type."
close_reason: "Adopted the pm-cli 2026.7.29 authoritative completion-timestamp contract. Replaced the hand-rolled chain in src/generator.ts with resolveCompletionTimestamp from @unbrained/pm-cli/sdk, preserving created_at as the final local fallback. Threaded source/fallback provenance through release attribution as ChangelogAttributionProvenance in the --explain selection report and stderr output, plus an actionable hint. Bumped devDep ^2026.7.29 and peerDep >=2026.7.29. Updated README.md and docs/usage.md."
body: ""
